# Backend boundaries
- Keep domain logic in `backend/src/domain`, orchestration in `services`, storage behind `persistence` contracts, API in `routes`.
- For status semantics consult `docs/adr/002-status.md` and the existing classifier. Do not duplicate status business logic.
- For planning semantics consult `docs/adr/003-planejamento.md` and `docs/adr/004-planejamento-baseline.md` only when affected.
- For dynamic hierarchy consult `docs/adr/001-hierarquia-dinamica.md` only when affected.
- Treat SQLite/PostgreSQL parity and migration as high-risk; avoid changing schema, contracts, or migration behavior without tests.
- Favor narrow tests near changed business logic. Do not assume `npm test` covers every `*.test.ts`.
